sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor St as Staff
    participant UI as SRS Console
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant BV as Brevo
    St->>UI: choose module, venue, date, slot
    UI->>API: POST /api/bookings
    activate API
    API->>DB: BEGIN, read module, venue capacity, registered students
    API->>DB: lock venue/date/slot
    alt capacity < 1, no students, already booked, hall full or a clash
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 409 + reason
        UI-->>St: error message
    else ok
        critical database transaction (continued)
            API->>DB: INSERT exam_bookings
            API->>DB: INSERT seat_reservations (seat numbers)
            API->>DB: COMMIT
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT email_outbox (one per student)
        API-->>UI: 201 booking + students not enrolled at this venue
        UI-->>St: booking shown in table and calendar
        API-)BV: send queued e-mails (background)
        BV-->>API: message id
        API->>DB: UPDATE email_outbox SET status = sent
    end
    deactivate API
    Note over St,BV: Exam day: timer every 60 s
    loop every minute
        API->>DB: sessions that ended (12:00 / 16:00)?
        opt a session has ended
            API->>DB: INSERT access_events (decision = signed_out) for everyone let in during it
        end
    end
